# Build artifacts
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo.lock is COMMITTED. This crate ships a binary artifact (an XCFramework
# built from an exact dependency set), so a reproducible build wins over the
# library convention of ignoring it.
# Do not add Cargo.lock here.

# Generated Swift and the framework built from it. Both are outputs of
# `make xcframework`, both are attached to a release, and neither is source.
/generated
/build
*.xcframework
*.xcframework.zip

# Secrets — nothing here should ever be a committed file, but this crate's
# whole subject is tickets and tokens, so make the mistake harder.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Local AI/assistant tooling — never tracked. Carried over from modelpipe and
# gglib, where these are scratch space for coding assistants (session state,
# worktrees, handoff notes). Machine-local, and must not enter history.
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
.continue/
.codeium/
.github/copilot-instructions.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Editors / tooling
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.iml
.direnv/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Swift package build output from the consuming smoke test
.build/
